  "description": "<p>Your non-magical gear is rusted.</p><p>Until the spell ends, if you hit on an attack with a metal weapon, it shatters. The weapon is treated as an <strong>Improvised Weapon</strong> for any further attacks.</p><p>Additionally, if you are attacked, your <strong>Armour</strong> is permanently reduced by the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt. If this reduces your <strong>Armor</strong> to 0, their <strong>Armor</strong> is destroyed.</p>",
